      %(Sahil Bloom popularized it as the <a href="https://www.sahilbloom.com/newsletter/the-1-1-1-method-forecasts-for-the-future-more" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:text-primary underline">1-1-1 method</a>. It sticks because it has a finish line: three lines and you're done.)
